// Positions in a source text, as the lexer counts them (card self-differential; Rust twin: warp_parser/scanning.rs
// advance, a column per code point: a character such as שָ of a letter and its vowel point takes two)
// todo code_points(line) These are probably calculated elsewhere too and can be optimized? (card code-points-once)

// The code points of a text as a list
def code_points(text: text): list := [point for point in text.codepoints]
